  "description": "Is your knowledge of Japanese culture still up to date?\n\n“You kind of know it.”\n“It’s just something we’ve always done.”\nBut many customs and traditions are followed without really knowing their meaning or origin.\n\nThis game is a Japanese culture knowledge quiz\nfocused on traditions, etiquette, and customs of Japan.\n\nDining etiquette, seasonal events, word meanings, and traditional manners.\nBased on everyday situations and traditional culture,\nyou’ll face quizzes about Japanese customs you may think you know.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the question  \n・Choose the answer by intuition  \n・Understand instantly with results and explanations  \n\nEven when you answer correctly, there’s still something to learn.\nEven when you’re wrong, you’ll think, “Ah, I see.”\n\nPlay from just one question at a time.\nPerfect for passing time or refreshing your cultural knowledge.\n\nHow much of your knowledge of Japanese culture still holds up today?\nWhy not put it to the test?\n\nThe game supports both button controls and touch controls, allowing you to play in TV mode, handheld mode, or tabletop mode.\n※This game is designed to be played on the Nintendo Switch™ in vertical orientation.",
